<title>USA: First Washington Realty sets stock offering.</title>
<headline>First Washington Realty sets stock offering.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Washington Realty Trust Inc said on Monday that it has completed a public offering of 1.5 million shares priced at $21.75 a share.</p>
<p>Proceeds of about $30.7 million will be used to acquire shopping centers, repay debt and renovate and expand certain properties, First Washington said.</p>
<p>The offering was underwritten by Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc, Friedman, Billings, Ramsey &amp; Co Inc and Tucker Anthony Inc, First Washington said.</p>
<p>The number of shares the company has outstanding was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
